AI: 
                                   Root Cause                                   

The payments namespace does not exist. The entire namespace has been deleted or 
was never created, resulting in zero available replicas for the payments        
service.                                                                        


                                    Findings                                    

 • No payments namespace found in the cluster                                   
 • No deployments, pods, services, or any resources exist in or related to      
   payments                                                                     
 • No payment-related resources found cluster-wide                              


                                      Fix                                       

Redeploy the payments service:                                                  

                                                                                
 # Create the namespace                                                         
 kubectl create namespace payments                                              
                                                                                
 # Apply your payments service manifests                                        
 kubectl apply -f <payments-deployment-manifests> -n payments                   
                                                                                

The alert will resolve once the payments deployment is restored with available  
replicas.                                                                       
